   "html": "<p>Everything after October 19, 2026 is invented; the facts in &quot;Starting point&quot; come from these pages.</p><ul><li><a href=\"https://ai-2027.com/race\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">AI 2027, race ending</a> and <a href=\"https://blog.aifutures.org/i/187696603/quantitative-pace-of-progress\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Grading AI 2027&#x27;s 2025 predictions</a> (AI Futures Project)</li><li><a href=\"https://techcrunch.com/2026/09/03/openai-launches-astra-its-powerful-and-controversial-new-model/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">OpenAI launches Astra</a> (TechCrunch) and <a href=\"https://openai.com/index/gpt-6-astra-next-generation-work\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">GPT-6 Astra</a> (OpenAI)</li><li><a href=\"https://openai.com/index/research-acceleration-view-inside-openai/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Research acceleration: the view inside OpenAI</a> (OpenAI)</li><li><a href=\"https://www.semafor.com/article/06/05/2026/anthropic-calls-for-ai-development-slowdown-to-ensure-safety\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Anthropic calls for AI slowdown</a> (Semafor) and <a href=\"https://nairametrics.com/2026/06/05/anthropic-calls-for-coordinated-mechanism-to-pause-ai-development/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">coordinated pause mechanism</a> (Nairametrics)</li><li><a href=\"https://techinformed.com/anthropic-launches-project-glasswing-to-prevent-ai-driven-cyberattacks/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Project Glasswing and Mythos Preview</a> (TechInformed)</li><li><a href=\"https://www.casrai.org/news/anthropic-fable-mythos-export-control-suspension\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Fable 5 / Mythos 5 export-control timeline</a> (CASRAI)</li><li><a href=\"https://elephas.app/resources/ai-going-rogue-examples\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Seven AI agent breakouts, July–August 2026</a> (Elephas)</li><li><a href=\"https://ai2roi.substack.com/p/ai-to-roi-news-and-analysis-october-c69\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">AI to ROI, October 16, 2026</a>: Muse Wonder, CoreWeave, the OpenAI spy case, Anthropic&#x27;s self-replication study</li><li><a href=\"https://bleepingcomputer.com/news/artificial-intelligence/openai-engineer-arrested-for-allegedly-planting-spy-device-in-office\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">OpenAI engineer arrested</a> (BleepingComputer)</li><li><a href=\"https://aiweekly.co/ai-news-today/edition/2026-10-15\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">AI news, October 15, 2026</a> (AI Weekly)</li><li><a href=\"https://www.citybiz.co/?p=916777\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">OpenAI annualized revenue</a> (Citybiz, citing Bloomberg)</li><li><a href=\"https://gpusmith.com/articles/en/pdfs/hyperscaler-ai-capex-2026.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Hyperscaler AI capex 2026</a> (GPU Smith)</li><li><a href=\"https://www.crowell.com/en/insights/client-alerts/white-house-announces-ai-responsibility-accord-executive-orders-and-super-intelligence-task-force\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">White House Accord on Super Intelligence</a> (Crowell &amp; Moring)</li><li><a href=\"https://www.pbs.org/newshour/amp/world/china-and-u-s-agree-to-establish-ai-safety-channel-and-continue-trade-and-military-talks\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">US–China AI incident channel</a> (PBS/AP)</li><li><a href=\"https://thenextweb.com/news/china-ai-export-controls-draft\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">China&#x27;s draft AI export controls</a> (The Next Web)</li><li><a href=\"https://www.nist.gov/news-events/news/2026/05/caisi-evaluation-deepseek-v4-pro\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">CAISI evaluation of DeepSeek V4 Pro</a> (NIST)</li><li><a href=\"https://dealroom.co/news/143742-deepseeks-leaked-investor-call-1-20th-the-compute-agi-or-nothing-and-the-\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">DeepSeek&#x27;s leaked investor call</a> (Dealroom)</li><li><a href=\"https://www.datalearner.com/en/benchmarks/metr-time-horizons-v1-1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">METR time horizons v1.1</a> (DataLearner) and <a href=\"https://www.greaterwrong.com/posts/PtavXeTFek2nyDM6r/dynomight-s-shortform/comment/oukcBZ8ZonfNZWdJx\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">time-horizon extrapolation</a> (LessWrong)</li><li><a href=\"https://www.thealgorithmicbridge.com/p/how-america-turned-against-ai-according\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">How America turned against AI</a> (The Algorithmic Bridge)</li><li><a href=\"https://www.aljazeera.com/amp/economy/2026/9/23/us-lawmakers-propose-sweeping-ai-restrictions-with-superintelligence-ban\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Sanders–Casar superintelligence ban</a> (Al Jazeera) and <a href=\"https://www.axios.com/2026/09/16/warren-ai-pause\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Warren backs pause</a> (Axios)</li><li><a href=\"https://www.techspot.com/news/113997-ai-job-apocalypse-hasnt-hit-recent-college-grads\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Recent-graduate unemployment, summer 2026</a> (TechSpot)</li><li><a href=\"https://www.orcarouter.ai/vi/blog/claude-opus-5-1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Opus release dates</a> (OrcaRouter)</li></ul>"
